  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="11" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">Now</char>, <char style="w" strong="G80">brothers</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1487">if</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">I</char> <char style="w" strong="G2089">{am} still</char> <char style="w" strong="G2784">preaching</char> <char style="w" strong="G4061">circumcision</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5101">why</char> <char style="w" strong="G2089">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G1377">am I still being persecuted</char>? <char style="w" strong="G686">In that case</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G4625">offense</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">of the</char> <char style="w" strong="G4716">cross</char> <char style="w" strong="G2673">has been abolished</char>. <verse style="v" number="12" /><char style="w" strong="G3588">As for those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G387">are agitating</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3785">I wish</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G609">they would proceed to emasculate themselves</char>!</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="13" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char>, <char style="w" strong="G80">brothers</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2564">were called</char> <char style="w" strong="G1909">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G1657">freedom</char>; <char style="w" strong="G3440">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">[do] not [use]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">[your]</char> <char style="w" strong="G1657">freedom</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">as</char> <char style="w" strong="G874">an opportunity</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">for the</char> <char style="w" strong="G4561">flesh</char>. <char style="w" strong="G235">Rather</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1398">serve</char> <char style="w" strong="G240">one another</char> <char style="w" strong="G1223">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G26">love</char>. <verse style="v" number="14" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">The</char> <char style="w" strong="G3956">entire</char> <char style="w" strong="G3551">law</char> <char style="w" strong="G4137">is fulfilled</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">in</char> <char style="w" strong="G1722">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1520">a single</char> <char style="w" strong="G3056">decree</char>: “<char style="w" strong="G25">Love</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">your</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4139">neighbor</char> <char style="w" strong="G5613">as</char> <char style="w" strong="G4572">yourself</char>.”<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">5:14 </char><char style="ft"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leviticus 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse style="v" number="15" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">But</char> <char style="w" strong="G1487">if</char> <char style="w" strong="G1143">you keep on biting</char> <char style="w" str